<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SUMMARY IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SUMMARY IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of game played in the Spanish first division on Saturday:</p>
<p>Valladolid 1 (Rafael Alkorta own goal, 58th minute) Real Madrid 1 (Davor Suker 16th). Halftime 0-1. Attendance 22,000.</p>
